00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:33.600
March is a month,

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.567
so it does not belong.

00:00:36.733 --> 00:00:37.467
Alright,

00:00:37.467 --> 00:00:39.667
a number series!

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:40.400
Six,

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:41.133
ten,

00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:41.867
fourteen,

00:00:41.867 --> 00:00:42.600
eighteen,

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.067
and then...

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:46.267
what comes next?

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:47.000
A.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:47.733
Twenty,

00:00:47.733 --> 00:00:48.467
B.

00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:49.200
