00:01:03.167 --> 00:01:03.767
twenty-two!

00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:07.267
Each number goes up by four:

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:07.867
six,

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:08.433
ten,

00:01:08.433 --> 00:01:09.033
fourteen,

00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:09.600
eighteen,

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:13.133
so eighteen plus four is twenty-two.

00:01:14.267 --> 00:01:15.333
Here's one,

00:01:15.333 --> 00:01:16.967
