00:08:08.367 --> 00:08:09.433
Here's one,

00:08:09.433 --> 00:08:11.033
a number puzzle,

00:08:11.033 --> 00:08:12.600
and it's sneaky!

00:08:12.600 --> 00:08:15.800
If two plus three makes eleven,

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:18.467
four plus one makes nine,

00:08:18.467 --> 00:08:21.100
three plus five makes twenty-three,

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.767
then two plus four makes...

00:08:23.767 --> 00:08:24.300
what?

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:24.833
A.

00:08:24.833 --> 00:08:25.367
Twelve,

00:08:25.367 --> 00:08:25.867
B.

00:08:25.867 --> 00:08:26.400
Sixteen,

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:26.933
C.

00:08:26.933 --> 00:08:27.467
Fourteen,

00:08:27.467 --> 00:08:28.533
or D.

00:08:28.533 --> 00:08:29.067
Eight?

00:08:29.067 --> 00:08:30.133
Five seconds!

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:37.100
TIME'S UP!

00:08:37.767 --> 00:08:39.067
The answer is...

00:08:39.067 --> 00:08:39.467
C,

00:08:39.467 --> 00:08:39.900
fourteen!

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:41.633
Multiply the two numbers,

00:08:41.633 --> 00:08:43.767
then add them both back:

00:08:43.767 --> 00:08:45.900
two times four is eight,

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:48.500
plus two plus four is fourteen.

00:08:49.633 --> 00:08:50.033
So,

00:08:50.033 --> 00:08:52.067
are you smart or fart?

00:08:52.067 --> 00:08:54.500
Count up your correct answers to

